# Copy this file to .env. Nothing here is required to build or load the
# extension. There's no OAuth setup either — the content script runs on the
# RStudio host itself (Posit Cloud / RStudio Server / Posit Workbench), so
# the logged-in session is the only credential the write path needs (see
# EXECUTION.md).

# Optional. If set, every raw text a student submits (successful or not — no
# names, no session/user id, nothing else) is POSTed here, fire-and-forget.
# Leave unset to disable input logging entirely (the default for a fresh
# clone). See Ninebark-DesmosExtension's google-apps-script/README.md for a
# free, ready-made endpoint that appends each input as a row in a Google
# Sheet you own — the same endpoint works here too.
VITE_INPUT_LOG_URL=
